+## Question Timer
+
+- **Quiz settings**: `timer_minutes` and `timer_seconds` (both integer `>= 0`, default `0`). `0` minutes and `0` seconds disables the timer (`timer_duration_seconds == 0`). Timer settings are local to Quizzy and excluded from quiz JSON export.
+- **Authoritative deadlines**: When a question opens (`Game#start!` / `Game#next_question!`) and `quiz.timer_duration_seconds > 0`, the server persists `current_question_ends_at = now + duration.seconds` on `games` and `timer_ends_at` on `game_questions`. Reloading any page never restarts the countdown because remaining time is derived from the persisted server deadline (`Game#timer_remaining_ms`).
+- **Auto-finish at 0:00**:
+  - `GameTimer` (`app/models/game_timer.rb`) schedules a thread-safe `Concurrent::ScheduledTask` for each open timed game that calls `Game#finish_if_expired!(expected_version:)` at `current_question_ends_at`, closing the question and broadcasting `question_closed` identically to clicking `"Finish"`, even if the moderator closes their browser tab.
